# ── Book-a-demo leads → Airtable ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Each demo-request submission is appended as a row to your Airtable table by
# the server route at /api/book-demo. These are server-only secrets — never
# expose them with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# Setup:
#  1. Create an Airtable base with a table (default name "Leads") that has these
#     columns:  Name (single line), Email (single line), Website (single line),
#     Message (long text).
#  2. Create a Personal Access Token at https://airtable.com/create/tokens with
#     the scope "data.records:write" and access to that base.
#  3. Copy the base id from the base's API docs / URL (starts with "app...").
#  4. Set the three vars below in your host's env (e.g. Vercel → Project →
#     Settings → Environment Variables) and redeploy.

AIRTABLE_TOKEN=
AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=
# Optional — defaults to "Leads"
AIRTABLE_TABLE_NAME=Leads
